    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLuxury, Space & Style in the Heart of Leixlip - A Home That Stands Apart\n\nLAST REMAINING 1-BEDROOM APARTMENT 62 sq m\n\nWelcome to Apartment 13, The Paddocks, a superb 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment extending to approximately 62 sq m, situated within this prestigious new development in Knockaulin, Leixlip, Co. Kildare.\n\nNow the last remaining 1-bedroom apartment available, Apartment 13 offers an exceptional opportunity to secure a stylish, high-quality home in one of Leixlip's most desirable new developments.\n\nThe Paddocks comprises of a small number of elegant family homes, together with a block of stylish 1 and 2-bedroom apartments, creating a private and exclusive setting.\n\nWith Leixlip village and its many amenities just moments away, The Paddocks combines quality, space and convenience in a thriving and well-connected community.\n\nKey Features:\n- Last remaining 1-bedroom apartment\n- Approximately 62 sq m\n- Exceptional build quality with high-spec finishes throughout\n- Bright and spacious open-plan kitchen/living/dining area\n- Private, low-maintenance outdoor space\n- Excellent location close to Leixlip village\n- Convenient access to excellent schools, transport links and Intel\n- Modern, energy-efficient new-build home\n\nWith its exceptional build quality, generous proportions and prime location, Apartment 13 represents an excellent opportunity to secure a high-quality new home in Leixlip.\n\nwww.paddocksleixlip.ie"
      },
      {
